            </note>
            <note corresp="#d188-f3" n="62" xml:id="d188-f3-content">
                <p>Lord Halifax, British Ambassador to the United States.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d188-f4" n="63" xml:id="d188-f4-content">
